sequenceDiagram
    actor H as Person
    participant S as Switchboard
    participant A as Author agent
    participant R as Independent reviewer
    participant G as GitHub

    H->>S: Open a review
    S->>A: Request explanation and claims
    A->>S: Diagram, claims, evidence, revision
    S->>R: Request independent checks
    R->>S: Verdicts, findings, evidence
    S-->>A: Findings needing a response
    A->>S: Fix or concede, with evidence
    S->>R: Recheck affected claims
    R->>S: Results and remaining disagreement
    S-->>H: Decision with both arguments
    H->>S: Choose an outcome

    alt More work or evidence required
        S-->>A: Record the required work and owner
        S-->>R: Request the next check
        Note over H,S: Review stays open
    else Record ready to post
        S-->>H: Show exact drafts and owners
        H->>S: Authorize these drafts
        S-->>A: Post your description update
        S-->>R: Post your batched review
        A->>G: Update using own account
        R->>G: Review using own account
        G-->>A: Posting receipt
        G-->>R: Posting receipt
        A->>S: Record receipt
        R->>S: Record receipt
    end

    Note over H,G: Merging remains the person's action
